From 26be8322b7ed260756ac682af7d5a117936de1e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 20 Aug 2025 17:13:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 047/190] dt-bindings: display: xlnx: mixer: Add
 xlnx,video-format

commit 4b5dfea1fa87513a1f6661b527e62247174187e9 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Fix missing xlnx,video-format property. This property represents mixer
output video format. This property is already supported by the system
device tree generator (sdtgen).

Signed-off-by: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250821001303.1178351-5-anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/xlnx/xlnx,mixer.txt | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/xlnx/xlnx,mixer.txt b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/xlnx/xlnx,mixer.txt
index 22eddebb82be..50f743d6a31f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/xlnx/xlnx,mixer.txt
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/xlnx/xlnx,mixer.txt
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@ Required properties:
  - xlnx,num-layers: Total number of layers (excluding logo)
    Value ranges from 1-9 for compatible string xlnx,mixer-3.0 and
    Value ranges from 1-17 for comptaible string xlnx,mixer-4.0 and above
+ - xlnx,video-format: Mixer output video format
+   Value range is 0..3, corresponding to RGB, YUV444, YUV422 and Y only
  - layer_[x]: node for [x] layer
  - xlnx,layer-id: layer identifier number
  - xlnx,vformat: video format for layer. See list of supported formats below.
@@ -94,6 +96,7 @@ Example:
 		xlnx,bpc = <8>;
 		xlnx,ppc = <2>;
 		xlnx,num-layers = <8>;
+		xlnx,video-format = <2>;
 		xlnx,logo-layer;
 		xlnx,bridge = <&v_tc_0>;
 
